SDL-E1031 (spec/index.md)

  x `1.2.3` is not a decimal number
   ,----
 1 | index diskann v { on: t; fields: a; dimension: 8; alpha: 1.2.3; };
   :                                                    ^^|^^
   :                                                      `-- not a decimal number
   `----
  help: unsigned decimal numbers only — digits with `_` separators, an optional `.` fraction, an optional `e` exponent (`1.2`, `1_000.5e-2`, `3f`); no sign, no `NaN`/`Infinity` spellings, and
        magnitudes under 2⁶³ (the emitted DDL prints the value bare, so it must re-parse upstream unchanged)
